        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00155",
          "explanation": "Doctor corrects the caregiver's confusion about medication continuation by specifically addressing the need to confirm with the discharge order.",
          "quote": "纸上那些破伤风免疫球蛋白、克林霉素输液、氯化钠、艾司奥美拉唑，主要是住院/急诊期间的记录，不是让我们回家自己继续打针。"
        }
